	(text "INA239 monitors the switched 12 V rail: 10 mOhm 4-terminal shunt (1 W at 10 A), SPI mode 1 on the main bus (CS from the decoder), +/-163.84 mV range (16.4 A). ALERT drives its LED and MCP23S08 GP6."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
